# A new entity with its own state class (extending-ies.md, "Specific guidance for
# extending Entities"). The entity is a subclass of both the IES4 entity and its new state.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ies: <http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#> .
@prefix ont: <http://example.com/local-ontology#> .

ont:Submarine a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ies:Vehicle,
        ont:SubmarineState .

ont:SubmarineState a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ies:VehicleState .

ont:Submerged a rdfs:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ont:SubmarineState .
